5
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:07,050
Bad news.

6
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,167
That's you.

7
00:00:08,221 --> 00:00:08,959
When you talk,

8
00:00:08,959 --> 00:00:10,070
