9
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:10,940
TWICE:

10
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,050
once through the air...

11
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,107
and once through your

12
00:00:13,107 --> 00:00:14,000
SKULL.

13
00:00:14,051 --> 00:00:14,958
The skull version

14
00:00:14,958 --> 00:00:16,300
