15
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,900
Like a movie trailer.

16
00:00:17,945 --> 00:00:18,669
But a microphone

17
00:00:18,669 --> 00:00:19,262
only gets

18
00:00:19,262 --> 00:00:20,467
