24
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,060
That boom?

25
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,033
Your skull.

26
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:29,911
The weird part?

27
00:00:29,911 --> 00:00:31,160
In one study,

28
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:31,807
people rated

29
